<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai authorities seized 8kg of hydroponic cannabis at the Nepal border and foiled a 700kg methamphetamine shipment bound for Malaysia, prompting heightened alert over cross-border drug networks. Bomb explosions in southern Thailand injured police, leading to tighter border security and expanded intelligence work, while a drone was detected attacking a Russian cargo ship in the Baltic, illustrating broader security concerns. Cambodia is escalating the Thailand border dispute at ASEAN and other international forums, receiving U.S. backing, and has detained Cambodians crossing a suspected minefield. China and Thailand are advancing rail links to Malaysia and Singapore, and Thailand is negotiating aviation hub status and cross-border water-pollution mitigation with China. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxORkpNZExsMzRuYnBVYW52eXRUWUw2aWUtaUZXdHFqMHZzTHZnTThiUHJEQVAtRmwyd0dhMHZ3TXN2QWVjYU85Ni04WlRXU0RPSGVaZHl4QnkxQUZ0QlE0Z3o0TDdMNHQwaHZwU1hTeVAxWXNud1hkd25PNXJVTmJKR0ZMbHQtWXNKVzQ2RVpjQmtrQ1diTFdfN1h5dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangkok Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPXzlZY1ZpWFViLTlubnEwQ1Bzd2dBNFczWmZCb2xlUlE4U2c1d1BwVXZPMV91U2UyZFB3MlJTcXVhWDYzNGYwYTZON1k0cGNVTU05ajJ1dFlxbmRoRVlfdnRVZ081OGxGNWVKb3N5ay1ob3hLLWRuVkQweDFTbHBSd3VYemc1dUlVOFJ4VlU4RDk1S19ldnN3ME9YVTY0eDNOeUlPUmNPSENVcGh0M1hVWXRuRHprZml0WUhqNzh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Malaysian Reserve&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPd2Rid3luSXRKMzdVbDZPSHhOUi16cHZaS3dLYlNrZThuSE9NRGU0Z2NnR3Y4S1o1b0NTTFpPM3ZUZEtLOTg1aXh0cVlHUXpidmdIb1VUQ255LVZXVUJIY0t5UUJPTUw2UXlsYUNpdHhnWXNqRWtDWkFoR3ZMd21HZ0xHaW